# T44974 (AWP-25167) -- Mirror set to interface none -- run 1 -- 2026-10-09

## What this case actually is
NOT a feature test. ck.db's summary names **CR56263** and says "Make sure system is stable
(was NSM crash)". It is a CRASH REGRESSION. It is graded on NSM staying up and the system
staying stable, NOT on "the mirror turned off". Evidence is therefore the NSM process, the
system uptime, the log, and continued control-plane and dataplane service.

