Testbox    tb277 (Test Engineer bidhanc@bidhanc-dl).  Consoles u2=swi_c (DUT), u3=swi_b, u5=swi_a.
PDU        10.36.230.212 outlet 1 (u2), outlet 7 (u3); 10.36.230.35 outlet 3 (u5).
Constraints none stated. Power cycles allowed. Sentinel: parent session.
Group      mirror-2026-10-08T1637. Setup G0-G4 / restore R0-R6 in the queue file (2df8463).

